---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BookingCTA from "../components/BookingCTA.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Meet Dr. Jee Hoon Ju"
  description="Dr. Jee Hoon Ju is an aesthetic medicine physician and International Director at Tune Clinic, Seoul, and founder of AetherHeal."
>
  <section class="wrap section grid-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Physician & founder</p>
      <h1>
        Jee Hoon Ju.
        <br />
        <em>A wider view.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Aesthetic medicine physician.
        <br />
        International Director, Tune Clinic.
        <br />
        Founder, AetherHeal Global Inc.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        I work with international patients in Seoul and build technology around
        the practical questions that arise in medicine: how to explain, how to
        decide, and how to keep people informed.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/book/">
        Book at Tune Clinic ↗
      </a>
    </div>
    <img
      class="portrait"
      src="/images/dr-ju.webp"
      alt="Dr. Jee Hoon Ju"
      width="960"
      height="1200"
    />
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap rule grid-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Approach</p>
      <h2>
        Listen carefully.
        <br />
        Explain <em>clearly.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="large-copy">
        A consultation should leave you with a better understanding of your
        choices.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        That means talking about what concerns you, the change you hope to see,
        previous treatment, and your time in Korea. It also means discussing
        uncertainty, alternatives and the option to wait.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Evidence informs the conversation. Your assessment determines whether a
        treatment is appropriate. The clinic confirms who will provide your
        care; booking through this website does not guarantee Dr. Ju as your
        treating physician.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section rule">
    <p class="eyebrow">Background</p>
    <h2>
      Education &<br />
      <em>professional interests.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="panel">
        <span class="number">01 / Medical education</span>
        <h3>University of Debrecen</h3>
        <p>
          Medical School. Listed in the current Tune Clinic physician profile.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <span class="number">02 / Continuing education</span>
        <h3>AI in Health Care</h3>
        <p>
          MIT Sloan Executive Education. Executive education is distinct from an
          MIT degree.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <span class="number">03 / Clinical communication</span>
        <h3>Care across borders</h3>
        <p>
          English-speaking consultation and international patient coordination
          at Tune Clinic.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fineprint" style="margin-top:25px">
      Professional background source:{" "}
      <a href="https://tuneclinic-global.com/doctors">
        Tune Clinic physician profile ↗
      </a>
      . This site does not claim dermatology or plastic surgery specialist
      certification.
    </p>
  </section>
  <BookingCTA />
</Layout>
